title Contract Lifecycle Flow

participant "Developer" as Dev
participant "Config Store" as Config
participant "DiscoveryPipeline" as Pipeline
participant "Semantic Cache" as Cache
participant "ContractRegistry" as Registry
participant "ContractRegistryBuilder" as Builder

note over Dev, Builder: Cache Location: OS User Home\n~/.i2vision/cache/projects/<project-hash>/.semantic-cache/

Dev->Config: Create contract definition\nto-structure.yaml\n"Vision promises to provide structure"
activate Config

Dev->Config: Create contract definition\nfrom-flow.yaml\n"Structure expects flow"
Config->Config: Store in config store
Config-->Dev: Definition saved (committed)

Dev->Pipeline: Execute discovery
activate Pipeline

Pipeline->Config: Read contract definitions
Config-->Pipeline: Contract rules

Pipeline->Cache: Discover artifacts
activate Cache
Pipeline->Cache: Analyze code
Pipeline->Cache: Generate mappings
Cache->Cache: Store {layer}-{target}-mappings.yaml
Cache->Cache: Generate validation results
Cache->Cache: Store validation-results.yaml
Cache-->Pipeline: Artifacts generated
deactivate Cache

Pipeline->Builder: Build contract registry
activate Builder
Builder->Config: Scan config store for definitions
Config-->Builder: List of definitions
Builder->Cache: Scan semantic cache for artifacts
Cache-->Builder: List of artifacts
Builder->Builder: Match definitions to artifacts
Builder->Builder: Calculate status (SATISFIED/VIOLATED/MISSING)
Builder->Builder: Calculate confidence scores
Builder->Registry: Save registry.yaml
Registry->Registry: Store in semantic cache
Registry-->Builder: Registry saved
Builder-->Pipeline: ContractRegistry
deactivate Builder

Pipeline->Registry: Query contract health
Registry-->Pipeline: Health score, violations, gaps

Pipeline->Registry: Get violated contracts
Registry-->Pipeline: List of violated contracts

Pipeline->Registry: Get missing contracts
Registry-->Pipeline: List of missing contracts

Pipeline-->Dev: Discovery complete with contract status
deactivate Pipeline

Dev->Registry: View contract health
Registry-->Dev: Status report

Dev->Config: Update contract definitions (if needed)
activate Config
Config->Config: Modify to-*.yaml or from-*.yaml
Config-->Dev: Definitions updated (committed)
deactivate Config

Dev->Pipeline: Re-run discovery
activate Pipeline
Pipeline->Cache: Regenerate artifacts
Cache-->Pipeline: Updated artifacts
Pipeline->Builder: Rebuild registry
Builder-->Pipeline: Updated registry
Pipeline-->Dev: Contract status updated
deactivate Pipeline
